        <ns2:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">precedes</ns2:IAO_0000111>
        <ns2:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">x precedes y if and only if the time point at which x ends is before or equivalent to the time point at which y starts. Formally: x precedes y iff ω(x) &lt;= α(y), where α is a function that maps a process to a start point, and ω is a function that maps a process to an end point.</ns2:IAO_0000115>
